            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Give the three learned forms. (Hablaré, hablarás, hablará.) What stays visible? (The whole infinitive.) What older verb contributed to the endings? (Latin habēre.) Next: test the same endings on comer."
            }
          ]
        }
